QUERY NAME: qryTimeCosts
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Month, Sum(MY_TimeCostCalcs.Pay) AS SumOfPay, Sum([NonPay]+[Overhead]) AS NonPayOH
FROM MY_TimeCostCalcs
GROUP BY MY_TimeCostCalcs.Year, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project, MY_TimeCostCalcs.Month
HAVING (((MY_TimeCostCalcs.Project)=[Forms]![frmProjectRadTrackData_Update]![Project]));

